# A value that a pass split by its type is tested at each use. Where the value does not change in a loop one test stands on the entry of the loop, and where two tests of one value follow each other closely or in a cycle one test stands in front of both: the old tests get the narrowed value and fold. A test that would only get an equal test in front of it stays as it is
